{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Chicken Craft</strong>\u00a0 a quirky chicken management game where you take control of a science farm hidden in a magical forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.poster.avif?t=1757529988\" width=800 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.webm?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a super-talented (and slightly explosive \ud83d\udca5) goblin engineer, unlock wild mutations, mix and match chicken parts, and hatch your very own flock of unique chickens! \ud83d\udc25\ud83d\udc14\ud83d\udc24</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/58bbcd6c1a4d766243254246e9dce5e3.poster.avif?t=1757529988\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/58bbcd6c1a4d766243254246e9dce5e3.webm?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/58bbcd6c1a4d766243254246e9dce5e3.mp4?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Upgrade your Scientific Farm</strong> - Expand your lab-farm hybrid, unlock new equipment, and grow your research facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/a912c88e96c717a651603a74772a747f.poster.avif?t=1757529988\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/a912c88e96c717a651603a74772a747f.webm?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/a912c88e96c717a651603a74772a747f.mp4?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Discover New Mutations</strong> - Unlock strange traits like mushroom heads, banana tails, and more as you expand your research.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Combine Chicken Parts\u00a0</strong>- Apply any discovered mutation to different chicken parts to create thousands of unique combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b27e6492220c39979ead730b1f157953.poster.avif?t=1757529988\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b27e6492220c39979ead730b1f157953.webm?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b27e6492220c39979ead730b1f157953.mp4?t=1757529988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Gather &amp; Craft</strong> - Collect resources to brew potions, create chicken feed, and fuel your experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Conduct Research for the Science Guild</strong> - Complete experiments, earn rewards, and unlock even wilder mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla